OL,3,GNEWSATrust vows to 'maintain spirit' of
OL,4,Anature reserve
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe National Trust has vowed to
OL,7,F"maintain the spirit" of a nature
OL,8,Freserve while making "some small
OL,9,Fchanges" after saving it from closure.
OL,11,FThe future of Flatford Wildlife Garden,
OL,12,Fnear East Bergholt in Suffolk, was
OL,13,Fthrown into doubt in October when the
OL,14,FRSPB said it would have to sell or
OL,15,Flease the land due to financial
OL,16,Fpressures.
OL,18,FIt was announced in April that the site
OL,19,Fwould be taken on by the National Trust
OL,20,Fand, on Tuesday, ownership of the
OL,21,Fgarden officially changed hands.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
