OL,3,GNEWSATrust vows to 'maintain spirit' of
OL,4,Anature reserve
OL,5,
OL,6,FRSPB Suffolk area manager Adam Rowlands
OL,7,Fsaid: "We are confident that their
OL,8,Fambitions for the site align with our
OL,9,Fown ethos of how we wanted to see
OL,10,FFlatford Wildlife Garden looked after
OL,11,Funder new ownership."
